stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Cart: Add Product

    Cart --> Pending Payment: Place Order<br/>POST /api/orders
    Cart --> [*]: Clear/Expire

    Pending Payment --> Cancelled: Payment Timeout<br/>Auto-Cancel After 30min
    Pending Payment --> Cancelled: User Cancelled
    Pending Payment --> Paying: Initiate Payment<br/>POST /api/payment/create

    Paying --> Pending Payment: Payment Failed
    Paying --> Paid: Payment Succeeded<br/>Webhook Confirmed

    Paid --> Pending Review: Risk Review<br/>Rule Engine Scoring
    Paid --> Picking: Approved

    Pending Review --> Picking: Approved
    Pending Review --> Cancelled: Rejected → Refund

    Picking --> Shipped: Picked Out<br/>Tracking Number Generated

    Shipped --> In Transit: Courier Pickup
    Shipped --> Shipped: Update Tracking

    In Transit --> Customs Inspection: Arrived in Destination Country
    Customs Inspection --> In Transit: Cleared After Inspection
    Customs Inspection --> Customs Detention: Inspection Exception
    Customs Detention --> In Transit: Docs Submitted · Cleared

    In Transit --> Delivered: Customer Signed
    In Transit --> Delivery Exception: Address/Contact Failure

    Delivery Exception --> In Transit: Redelivery
    Delivery Exception --> Returned: Returned to Sender

    Delivered --> Completed: Auto Confirm<br/>No After-Sales in 7 Days

    Delivered --> Refunding: Request Return/Refund
    Refunding --> Return Pending: Merchant Approved

    Return Pending --> Returning: Customer Ships
    Returning --> Returned: Warehouse Received
    Returned --> Refunding: QC Passed
    Returned --> Delivered: QC Failed → Returned to Customer

    Refunding --> Refunded: Refund Complete<br/>Original Payment Method

    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of Pending Payment: Stock Reserved 30min
    note right of Paying: Stripe/PayPal/Klarna/Adyen
    note right of Paid: Stock Deducted Permanently
    note right of In Transit: Webhook Push Updates
    note right of Delivered: Auto-Confirm Receipt in 7 Days
